---
const key=import.meta.env.PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY;
---
<section><h2>Schreib uns</h2>{key?<form id="contact-form" action="/api/contact" method="post"><label>Dein Name<input name="name" required maxlength="100" autocomplete="name"/></label><label>E-Mail-Adresse<input type="email" name="email" required maxlength="254" autocomplete="email"/></label><label>Betreff<input name="subject" required maxlength="150"/></label><label>Nachricht<textarea name="message" required minlength="10" maxlength="5000" rows="6"></textarea></label><label class="honeypot" aria-hidden="true">Website<input name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"/></label><label><input type="checkbox" name="privacy" value="yes" required/> Ich habe die <a href="/datenschutz/">Datenschutzhinweise</a> gelesen.</label><div class="cf-turnstile" data-sitekey={key} data-action="contact"></div><button class="button" type="submit">Nachricht senden ↗</button><p class="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></form>:<p>Du erreichst uns direkt über die oben genannten E-Mail-Adressen. Das Kontaktformular wird nach Einrichtung des Mailversands freigeschaltet.</p>}</section>{key&&<script is:inline src="https://challenges.cloudflare.com/turnstile/v0/api.js" async defer></script>}
<script>const form=document.querySelector<HTMLFormElement>('#contact-form');form?.addEventListener('submit',async e=>{e.preventDefault();const status=form.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[role=status]')!;const button=form.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('button')!;button.disabled=true;status.textContent='Nachricht wird gesendet …';try{const response=await fetch(form.action,{method:'POST',body:new FormData(form)});const data=await response.json();status.textContent=data.message;if(response.ok)form.reset();}catch{status.textContent='Der Versand ist gerade nicht möglich. Bitte versuche es erneut oder schreibe uns direkt per E-Mail.';}finally{button.disabled=false;(window as any).turnstile?.reset();}});</script>
